  "body": "> as an aside (and in a separate PR), we should plumb req.Context() to getCreds() and timeout the exec call if the driving request context expires\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @liggitt in https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/106768#discussion_r787203758_\r\n\r\nIf the request is terminated (i.e. times out), we should kill the client-go credential plugin instead of waiting for it to complete.  This change should include unit and integration tests.",
